<p>This document was published by the <a href="https://www.w3.org/groups/wg/webauthn/">Web Authentication Working Group</a> as a <strong>First Public Working Draft</strong> using the <a href="https://www.w3.org/policies/process/20250818/#recs-and-notes">Recommendation track</a>. Publication as a First Public Working Draft does not imply endorsement by W3C and its Members.</p>

<p>This First Public Working Draft, published on [DATE], begins public review of Web Authentication Level 4. It builds on <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/2026/REC-webauthn-3-20260825/">Web Authentication Level 3</a>, published as a W3C Recommendation on 25 August 2026. The changes since Level 3 are documented in <a href="#changes-since-l3">Changes since Web Authentication Level 3</a>.</p>

<p>This is a draft document and may be updated, replaced, or obsoleted by other documents at any time. It is inappropriate to cite this document as other than a work in progress.</p>

